OL,3,GNEWSA'Our hearts will never be full
OL,4,Aagain,' family says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Our hearts will never be full again,"
OL,7,Fa family has said, following the death
OL,8,Fof a 19-year-old man who they added was
OL,9,F"the most kindest, genuine soul anyone
OL,10,Fcould ever meet."
OL,12,FBradley Whieldon, from Abbey Hulton,
OL,13,FStoke-on-Trent, died at the scene of an
OL,14,Fincident on Brookhouse Road, in Meir,
OL,15,Fat around 23:45 BST on Friday.
OL,17,FAnother man, in his late teens, who was
OL,18,Fseriously injured in the incident
OL,19,Fremains in a stable condition in
OL,20,Fhospital, police said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
